  abilityName: Fatecutter Blow
  abilityDesc: 14 combo powerful Dark attack on all foes, 4 combo powerful Dark attack
    on single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), casts stealth on self boosting
    own Atk and critical hit rate for 3 turns, considerably raises normal hit amount
    for 3 turns & powerful additional attack at turn's end for 3 turns
